"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tae is Jun’s classmate, childhood friend, and neighbor. She’s a trombone player and is the vice-head of the brass band. She’s a friendly and cheery girl and gets along well with everyone. Tae wakes Jun up every morning and also makes him lunch since she’s a great cook. She cares about Jun a lot, and she has had feelings for him forever. She and Jun talk to each other from their windows at night."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3197"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担当パート・トロンボーン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ブラスバンド部副部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかな性格で、しっかりものの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく気がつき、面倒見が良く、頼まれると断れないタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の世話をよく焼き、影から精神的に支える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に想いをよせているが、今までの関係が壊れることを恐れて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ずっと告白できないままでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり人のことを疑わないタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心配性なところもあったりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまに人の斜め上を行く想像をしたりする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13464","sourceWorkId":"7535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担当パート・トロンボーン"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"中ノ島　妙（なかのしま　たえ）　CV：榊原ゆい"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穏やかな性格でしっかりものの女の子。よく気がつき、面倒見が良く、頼まれると断れないタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ブラスバンド部副部長。主人公の世話をよく焼き、影から精神的に支える。主人公に想いをよせているが、今までの関係が壊れることを恐れて、ずっと告白できないままでいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13648"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c14c939a985d7fa403afa6426a47ba58b187b3e6f3ca1b3ef62cd9528efd3e2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0b38b7cca036db3bbcd8f65a7c20730b59534949f1f88a2a8ead6bc8b0e0013.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榊原ゆい","creatorId":"vndb:s272","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s272","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s272","name":"榊原 ゆい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21757:13648:4916:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c3198","characterName":"雲雀丘 由貴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13651","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21757"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13467"],"vndbCharacterId":"c3198"},"originalCharacterName":"雲雀丘 由貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"822"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yuki is the conductor of the opposing brass band; she’s a tsundere from a rich family. She takes her job as conductor very seriously and is a perfectionist. She doesn’t have all that much confidence in her abilities, though."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3198"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担当パート・指揮者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誇り高く、完璧主義で時に非情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ったことはハッキリ言う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝負相手のブラスバンド部の部長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部員に厳しく自分に厳しく、孤高の人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝負に対しては正々堂々、主人公達も平等に扱う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の技術と自分が率いるバンドに絶対の自信と誇りを持つが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"密かに部に溶け込んでいる主人公をうらやましく思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素直になれないところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一流の楽器を部員に買い与えていて、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あと部に足りない物は部員たちの個々の努力、と考えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外と努力家であったり、なかったり……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13467","sourceWorkId":"7535","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担当パート・指揮者"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雲雀丘　由貴（ひばりがおか　ゆき）　CV：斉藤愛子"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"誇り高く、完璧主義で時に非情。思ったことはハッキリ言う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝負相手のブラスバンド部の部長。部員に厳しく自分に厳しく、孤高の人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"勝負に対しては正々堂々、主人公達も平等に扱う。自分の技術と自分が率いるバンドに絶対の自信と誇りを持つが、密かに部に溶け込んでいる主人公をうらやましく思っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"13651"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/ca7effd7fd340a6106190d1a79df971bcf8d0c8574eafcaa178aa6b019fab343.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c9a633837607b8b535461b89b3083caabcc36f9a7cfcc0a3075c09c75a0631c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"神田理江","creatorId":"vndb:s858","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s858","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s858","name":"神田 理江","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:21757:13651:4618:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c3199","characterName":"御影 須美","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"13652","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"21757"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13468"],"vndbCharacterId":"c3199"},"originalCharacterName":"御影 須美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"517"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sumi is Jun’s kouhai and also the drummer of the opposing brass band before she moved to Jun’s band (due to bullying). She’s a very quiet girl who finds it hard to stand up for herself. She relies on her best friend - an energetic girl named Kyoko - quite a lot."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3199"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"担当パート・パーカッション。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おどおどして、はっきり喋れない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いじめられやすいタイプ